issue(id="0026" status="review")
  title Align dependency release-age exceptions
  user-story
    as-a Repository maintainer
    i-want First-party dependencies to bypass the release-age delay at every version
    so-that Updates to maintained packages can be consumed immediately.
  premise.
    The exception list is limited to comline, takua, and transitive treetrunks, which this
    repository resolves from npm. Other packages retain the one-day release-age delay.
  acceptance-criteria
    criterion Renovate and pnpm exempt the same three unversioned npm package names.
    criterion pnpm explicitly enforces a minimum release age of 1440 minutes.
    criterion Existing dependency grouping and release automation remain intact.
  review-items
    item(status="covered") Confirmed the first-party intersection against the committed lockfile.
    item(status="open") Review the dependency policy configuration changes.
